components-checkbox.description:
Checkbox (Figma 416:30): Size 24 | 20 × Checked × State Default | Disabled.

A real `<input type="checkbox">` inside a `<label>`: Space, the label, form submit and screen readers all work
natively. The box is drawn on top:
 - press: the box shrinks to 0.9 on pointer-down and comes back softer on release;
 - check: the box fills blue first (120 ms, the response to the tap), then the check draws itself like a pen —
   the short stroke slows into the corner, the long one takes off again and lands softly (260 ms);
 - uncheck: the check is erased faster (140 ms) and the box turns grey;
 - CSS transitions, so a quick double tap reverses from wherever the stroke is;
 - from the keyboard (Space) the change is instant; reduced motion: no draw, the check fades.
 - the whole row (or, for a bare box, a 44 × 44 zone around it) is the touch target.

